ctions in the binding reaction of aminoacyl-tRNA (AA-tRNA) to ribosomes	Member of the heat shock protein 70 (HSP70) family; may be involved in protein folding; localized to the cytoplasm; highly homologous to the heat shock protein Sse1p	
